  "-The Device Firmware Update (DFU) app that is compatible with Nordic Semiconductor nRF51822 devices that have the S110 SoftDevice and bootloader enabled.\n\n-It allows to upload new application onto the device over-the-air (OTA).\n\n-The DFU discovers supported DFU devices, connects to them, and uploads user selected firmware applications to the device.\n\n-Default number of Packet Receipt Notification is 10 but you can set up other number in the iPhone Settings.\n\n-(New) Bin format is also supported in this version.\n\n-(New) This version supports Nordic Semiconductor softdevice 7.1 and SDK 7.1 and it is backword compatible. \n\n-(New) In SDK 7.0 and above initPacket is sent in a file (.dat) in addition to firmware file.\n\n-(New) For Application update application.hex or application.bin and application.dat is required inside a zip file.\n\n-(New) For Bootloader update bootloader.hex or bootloader.bin and bootloader.dat is required inside a zip file.\n\n-(New) For Softdevice update softdevice.hex or softdevice.bin and softdevice.dat is required.\n\n-(New) For updating both softdevice and bootloader system.dat is required in addition.": "-适用于启用了 S110 SoftDevice 和引导加载程序的 Nordic Semiconductor nRF51822 设备的设备固件更新 (DFU) 应用。\n\n-可通过无线方式 (OTA) 将新应用上传到设备。\n\n-DFU 会查找支持 DFU 的设备、连接设备，并上传用户选择的固件应用。\n\n-数据包接收通知的默认数量为 10，也可以在 iPhone 设置中更改。\n\n-(新增) 此版本也支持 Bin 格式。\n\n-(新增) 此版本支持 Nordic Semiconductor SoftDevice 7.1 和 SDK 7.1，并向后兼容。\n\n-(新增) SDK 7.0 及更高版本中，initPacket 除固件文件外还会通过 .dat 文件发送。\n\n-(新增) 更新应用时，zip 文件中必须包含 application.hex 或 application.bin，以及 application.dat。\n\n-(新增) 更新引导加载程序时，zip 文件中必须包含 bootloader.hex 或 bootloader.bin，以及 bootloader.dat。\n\n-(新增) 更新 SoftDevice 时，必须包含 softdevice.hex 或 softdevice.bin，以及 softdevice.dat。\n\n-(新增) 同时更新 SoftDevice 和引导加载程序时，还必须包含 system.dat。",
  "-User can add Folders and Files with Hex, Bin and Zip extensions from Emails and iTunes.\n\n-User added files will be appeared here.\n\n- In order to add files from iTunes:\n   1. Open iTunes on your PC and connect iPhone to it.\n   2.On the left, under Devices select your iPhone.\n   3.on the top, select tab Apps.\n   4. on the bottom, under File Sharing select app nRF Toolbox and then add files.": "-用户可以从电子邮件和 iTunes 添加 Hex、Bin 和 Zip 格式的文件夹及文件。\n\n-用户添加的文件会显示在此处。\n\n-通过 iTunes 添加文件：\n   1. 在电脑上打开 iTunes，并将 iPhone 连接到电脑。\n   2.在左侧的“设备”下选择 iPhone。\n   3.在顶部选择“应用”标签页。\n   4.在底部的“文件共享”下选择 nRF Toolbox 应用，然后添加文件。",
  "-User can add Folders and Files with Hex, Bin and Zip extensions from Emails and iTunes.\n\n-User added files will be appeared on tab User Files.\n\n- In order to add files from iTunes:\n   1. Open iTunes on your PC and connect iPhone to it.\n   2.On the left, under Devices select your iPhone.\n   3.on the top, select tab Apps.\n   4. on the bottom, under File Sharing select app nRF Toolbox and then add files.\n\n- In order to add files from Emails:\n   1. Attach file to your email.\n   2.Open your email on your iPhone.\n   3.Long click on attached file and then select Open in nRF Toolbox.": "-用户可以从电子邮件和 iTunes 添加 Hex、Bin 和 Zip 格式的文件夹及文件。\n\n-用户添加的文件会显示在“用户文件”标签页中。\n\n-通过 iTunes 添加文件：\n   1. 在电脑上打开 iTunes，并将 iPhone 连接到电脑。\n   2.在左侧的“设备”下选择 iPhone。\n   3.在顶部选择“应用”标签页。\n   4.在底部的“文件共享”下选择 nRF Toolbox 应用，然后添加文件。\n\n-通过电子邮件添加文件：\n   1. 将文件作为附件添加到电子邮件中。\n   2.在 iPhone 上打开邮件。\n   3.长按附件，然后选择“在 nRF Toolbox 中打开”。",
