  "Configure your Turn Touch wooden remote and put lights, music, and everyday actions at your fingertips. Choose actions for single taps, double taps, and holds, or combine several actions on one button.\n\nPair a remote over Bluetooth, choose your apps and devices, and customize your buttons in Settings. Turn Touch supports compatible smart-home devices and services; available functions depend on the integration and device.\n\nA Turn Touch remote is sold separately. Some integrations require compatible hardware, local network access, or a third-party account.\n\nLearn more: https://turntouch.com": "配置您的 Turn Touch 木质遥控器，让灯光、音乐和日常操作触手可及。为单击、双击和长按设置操作，也可以在一个按键上组合多项操作。\n\n通过蓝牙配对遥控器，选择应用和设备，并在“设置”中自定义按键。Turn Touch 支持兼容的智能家居设备和服务；可用功能取决于集成服务和设备。\n\nTurn Touch 遥控器需另行购买。部分集成需要兼容硬件、本地网络访问权限或第三方账户。\n\n了解更多：https://turntouch.com",
